# Research Conventions

## Experiment Discipline

- NEVER modify collected traces after collection
- NEVER re-run an experiment with modified parameters under the same name
- ALWAYS create a new experiment YAML for parameter changes
- ALWAYS validate harness on pilot (3-5 tasks) before full runs
- ALWAYS include safety evaluation in every experiment

## Code Style

- Python 3.11+, type hints on all functions
- Async where API calls are involved
- Ruff for formatting and linting
- Dataclasses for structured data, Pydantic for validation

## Memory Protocol

- Update memory.json after every session with new findings
- Append to wiki/log.md for every significant action
- Track landscape changes (new papers, models, API pricing)

## Reproducibility

- Every experiment must be rerunnable from its YAML definition
- Random seeds are explicit and recorded in traces
- Model versions recorded in every trace
- API request/response pairs logged for debugging
